    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the \u201cIce &amp; Fire Unrivaled&quot;, players take on the role of a powerful adventurer, entering ruins to search for treasures. The entire treasure hunt process was filled with tension and excitement. As an action role-playing  here can bring you an unparalleled gaming experience. Defeat enemies and obtain spoils of war, cultivate powerful characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954050/extras/378fbd2b337915744f213372f13a8db3.avif?t=1735718011\" width=506 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems to enhance skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By searching for treasure chests and defeating enemies, you can obtain gems, which can be used to enhance your own abilities and increase your magic level. When encountering obstacles from strong enemies, level up your character and challenge again after becoming stronger. Both new and experienced players of action games can enjoy the fun brought by the game. After experiencing death, we should strive to survive even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954050/extras/1e054df03f6db220a2cf196a90e53a83.avif?t=1735718011\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perilous ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins are full of dangerous enemies and also contain various treasures. In order to reach the depths of the ruins, various mechanisms must be unlocked to defeat powerful monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your weapons and embark on an adventure to search for treasures.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the \u201cIce &amp; Fire Unrivaled&quot;, players take on the role of a powerful adventurer, entering ruins to search for treasures. The entire treasure hunt process was filled with tension and excitement. As an action role-playing  here can bring you an unparalleled gaming experience. Defeat enemies and obtain spoils of war, cultivate powerful characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954050/extras/378fbd2b337915744f213372f13a8db3.avif?t=1735718011\" width=506 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems to enhance skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By searching for treasure chests and defeating enemies, you can obtain gems, which can be used to enhance your own abilities and increase your magic level. When encountering obstacles from strong enemies, level up your character and challenge again after becoming stronger. Both new and experienced players of action games can enjoy the fun brought by the game. After experiencing death, we should strive to survive even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954050/extras/1e054df03f6db220a2cf196a90e53a83.avif?t=1735718011\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perilous ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins are full of dangerous enemies and also contain various treasures. In order to reach the depths of the ruins, various mechanisms must be unlocked to defeat powerful monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your weapons and embark on an adventure to search for treasures.</p>",
